WEBVTT

01:03.856 --> 01:05.566
You've let me down badly.

01:08.194 --> 01:10.362
You know what you have to do.

01:11.280 --> 01:13.908
You're not serious, boss.

01:14.784 --> 01:17.953
I was planning to kill all of you.

01:18.370 --> 01:20.998
But I'll give you a second chance.

01:21.582 --> 01:23.042
If you show me how sorry you are.

01:24.460 --> 01:26.128
An offering for a job.

01:28.798 --> 01:29.673
You can't do it?

02:12.925 --> 02:13.801
I got it.

02:14.426 --> 02:17.304
I'll do it. I'll do it.

03:06.353 --> 03:08.105
Normal. Minnesota.

03:11.692 --> 03:12.526
Normal.

03:12.818 --> 03:14.236
Go there and redeem yourself.

48:05.550 --> 48:06.259
No answer.

48:07.510 --> 48:08.845
What the fuck?

48:10.763 --> 48:11.598
Okay, you sons of bitches!

48:12.348 --> 48:13.099
We fly tonight!

58:41.060 --> 58:42.853
10 fucking hours...

58:45.439 --> 58:46.398
My ass aches.

01:13:27.278 --> 01:13:29.989
You got some explaining
to do, don't you?

01:13:30.115 --> 01:13:32.325
Yes, I have several explanations.

01:14:18.538 --> 01:14:20.915
I don't know what the hell
you guys are talking about!

01:14:21.875 --> 01:14:23.626
We must get going.

01:14:23.751 --> 01:14:25.378
Bank! Bank!

01:14:26.129 --> 01:14:27.881
Don't you get it?

01:14:28.840 --> 01:14:30.008
Are we going now or what?

01:14:43.354 --> 01:14:44.522
Let's go, hurry up.

01:14:44.772 --> 01:14:45.857
You start driving.

01:14:56.868 --> 01:15:00.663
How can these assholes get lost
on a straight road!

01:15:05.793 --> 01:15:06.920
This is it?

01:15:09.380 --> 01:15:11.216
My money better be safe.

01:15:22.602 --> 01:15:24.270
-Where's Haru?
-Killed.

01:15:24.395 --> 01:15:25.313
And the vault?

01:15:55.927 --> 01:15:57.220
Now, who's hungry?
